"For bi-directional protocols a UART whose ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` is set to "
"\"23\" is required to be used and connection to the UART's TX pin, refer to "
"the :ref:`ArduPilot Radio Control System documentation <common-rc-systems>` "
"for details."
msgstr ""
"对于双向协议，需要使用 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 设为「23」的 UART，并连接至该 UART 的 TX 引脚，详情请参阅 "
":ref:`ArduPilot 遥控系统文档 <common-rc-systems>`。"

